OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom Christ Church Moss Side,
OL,6,     GManchester, with the Choral
OL,7,     GScholars of St Martin-in-the-
OL,8,     GFields and Diocese of Manchester
OL,9,     GChoral Scholars.
OL,10,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,11,     GDonald Macleod explores George
OL,12,     GGershwin's time in Paris in the
OL,13,     Gspring of 1928 and the music it
OL,14,     Ginspired.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,17,     Gcellists Julian Lloyd Webber and
OL,18,     GJiaxin Lloyd Webber, and pianist
OL,19,     GRebeca Omordia, as well as London
OL,20,     GSoundtrack Festival artistic
OL,21,     Gdirector Michael Beek.
