OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe London Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,9,     Gperforms Anna Thorvaldsdottir's
OL,10,     GCATAMORPHOSIS and Beethoven's 6th
OL,11,     GSymphony. Plus Bruch's Violin
OL,12,     GConcerto with Nikolaj Szeps-
OL,13,     GZnaider.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,15,     GKate Kennedy meets principal
OL,16,     GFrench horn player Robin Graham
OL,17,     Gto learn what it means for a
OL,18,     Gmusician's relationship with
OL,19,     Gtheir instrument when injury
OL,20,     Gforces them to stop playing.
